  "description": "<p>There is a certain amount of repeated XML in Maven configurations for projects inheriting from org.fcrepo:fcrepo. These projects include:</p>\n\n<p>\t⁃\tfcrepo-build-tools<br/>\n\t⁃\tfcrepo4<br/>\n\t⁃\tfcrepo-message-consumer<br/>\n\t⁃\tfcrepo-module-auth-rbacl<br/>\n\t⁃\tfcrepo-module-auth-xacml<br/>\n\t⁃\tfcrepo-camel<br/>\n\t⁃\tontology<br/>\n\t⁃\tfcrepo4-client<br/>\n\t⁃\tfcrepo-audit<br/>\n\t⁃\tfcrepo-camel-toolbox<br/>\n\t⁃\tfcrepo-webapp-plus<br/>\n\t⁃\tfcrepo4-release-tests<br/>\n\t⁃\tfcrepo4-oaiprovider<br/>\n\t⁃\tfcrepo4-swordserver<br/>\n\t⁃\tmigration-utils</p>\n\n<p>This ticket is to find all such redundancies, and move that config up into the pom in org.fcrepo:fcrepo.</p>",
